  "goodToKnow": "Die Zuwanderung is immigration: die Zuwanderung von Fachkräften, gesteuerte Zuwanderung (managed immigration). It's very close to die Einwanderung; Zuwanderung is broader and also covers people who come temporarily or within the EU. The 2005 Zuwanderungsgesetz was Germany's first comprehensive immigration law. Die Abwanderung is the opposite: people moving away, a big issue for many rural regions in eastern Germany."
